  "description": "This package is about controlling Ikea's Idasen Desk using Windows 10 and BluetoothLE. Ikea only provides an Android and IOs app to control the desk. I thought it would be far more convenient to control the desk using a Windows 10 system tray application. This repository contains all the low level code to detect and control the desk.",
